<speak>
<s>This is your briefing for <say-as interpret-as="date" format="dmy">15072026</say-as>.</s>
<break time="1s"/>
<prosody rate="95%">
<s>India's textile makers begin shipping to Britain duty-free today, as a sweeping free-trade pact between the two nations enters force.</s> <s>The deal scraps tariffs on ninety-nine percent of goods moving each way, and aims to nearly double two-way trade to one hundred billion dollars by twenty thirty.</s> <s>Lead the asymmetry, not the ceremony... a post-Brexit Britain hunting for markets and a rising India codifying who gets to make what.</s>
</prosody>
<p>
<s>In politics.</s><break time="400ms"/>
<s>The Sindh High Court in Karachi ordered a sealed farm reopened, ruling that any move against so-called illegal foreigners must first come with notice and a hearing.</s> <s>Authorities had targeted the property under a drive against suspected Afghan front men, even though records confirmed the owner's Pakistani citizenship.</s> <s>It's a rare judicial brake on a deportation campaign that has swept up long-settled Afghan families across the country.</s>
<break time="600ms"/>
<s>A federal court in Abuja remanded the Nigerian journalist Stanley Ugagbe until September, after police charged him under the country's cyberstalking law.</s> <s>His outlet had reported on a bank deputy governor's undisclosed properties, and the statute, written for online abuse, is increasingly the tool used to jail reporters before trial.</s> <s>His bail hearing now waits behind the court's summer recess.</s>
<break time="600ms"/>
<s>France agreed to let Ukraine build Aster thirty interceptors and glide bombs on its own soil, shifting Kyiv from donated arms toward a domestic weapons industry.</s> <s>Hours later, twenty-five Ukrainian troops marched in the Bastille Day parade alongside thirty-five allied nations.</s> <s>Kyiv can keep building those interceptors regardless of what happens on the front line.</s>
<break time="600ms"/>
<s>A court in Badajoz convicted the brother of Spain's prime minister, finding a music-conservatories post had been created solely for him.</s> <s>He also lost his voting rights for nine years, one of several graft cases circling Pedro Sánchez, whose former aide already drew a twenty-four-year sentence in a separate matter.</s> <s>He can still appeal.</s>
<break time="600ms"/>
<s>Mexico sent cease-and-desist letters to Adelanto, California, after seventeen Mexican nationals died in United States immigration custody.</s> <s>Four of those deaths happened at that one facility, and Mexico City has asked the United Nations to review every death recorded since twenty twenty-five.</s> <s>Its embassy now plans a formal complaint to the American Justice Department.</s>
<break time="600ms"/>
<s>South Africa's chief justice, Mandisa Maya, warned that apex-court rulings now take two hundred and fourteen days on average.</s> <s>The judiciary controls its verdicts, she said, but not its budget, staffing, or buildings, leaving the courts dependent on the very executive they exist to check.</s> <s>Draft legislation for a fully independent court administration is only now taking shape.</s>
</p>
<p>
<s>On the economy.</s><break time="400ms"/>
<s>Washington is backing a pipeline to route Iraq's crude to Syria's coast, letting Baghdad's exports skip the Strait of Hormuz entirely.</s> <s>Ninety percent of Iraq's oil currently transits that one waterway, and Iran's recent closure cut output to one and a half million barrels a day.</s> <s>Pipeline geography, not naval power, may end up deciding who controls Gulf energy flows.</s>
<break time="600ms"/>
<s>In Brussels, six bodies were pulled from a single elevator after fire raced up the lift shaft of the Oxy Tower during renovation work.</s> <s>Flames on the second floor trapped the workers before crews could force the car open, prosecutors said.</s> <s>A second lift still awaits inspection for further victims.</s>
<break time="600ms"/>
<s>In Nyala, thirty-five dialysis patients died over two months, as only four of the city's twelve machines still function.</s> <s>Sudan's fighting, which erupted in twenty twenty-three, wrecked the maintenance and supply chains that kept them running.</s> <s>Officials have pledged to repair five machines within weeks, raising capacity to eight, God willing.</s>
<break time="600ms"/>
<s>In Egypt, a military-linked authority now sets fertilizer prices, undercutting the market by as much as thirty-nine percent.</s> <s>It moved in after the government slashed subsidized fertilizer for citrus and other crops, and the farm ministry plays no role in the new scheme.</s> <s>Exports, meanwhile, are claiming a growing share of the supply.</s>
</p>
<p>
<s>In science.</s><break time="400ms"/>
<s>At Baikonur, two Russian cosmonauts and one American astronaut launched together aboard a single Soyuz capsule, docking with the space station.</s> <s>Russia and the United States also agreed to coordinate satellite tracking, since shared life-support systems force a cooperation that politics blocks everywhere else on Earth.</s> <s>The crew now begins a two-hundred-and-sixty-one-day mission in orbit.</s>
<break time="600ms"/>
<s>A South Korean team in Changwon hid Teflon nanoparticles inside silver plating, making the coating harder and far more resistant to wear.</s> <s>They dispersed the particles in a cyanide-free bath, avoiding the toxic chemistry that has long governed industrial silver plating.</s> <s>The composite could replace poisonous baths used across electronics manufacturing.</s>
</p>
<p>
<s>In technology.</s><break time="400ms"/>
<s>The Chinese artificial-intelligence startup DeepSeek is nearing a seventy-one-billion-dollar valuation, a jump of forty-two percent within a single month.</s> <s>It runs on Huawei chips despite American export controls, and processed nearly a quarter of all tokens on one major gateway in June.</s> <s>DeepSeek could now list publicly this year, well ahead of its planned twenty twenty-seven debut.</s>
<break time="600ms"/>
<s>Dutch intelligence warned that a Russian spy agency is hijacking Europe's internet-connected cameras to watch specific targets.</s> <s>Traffic cameras, doorbells, and security feeds can all be seized remotely, turning the continent's ordinary surveillance hardware against the people it was meant to protect.</s> <s>The advisory stopped short of naming the agency involved.</s>
<break time="600ms"/>
<s>Twenty-six former Meta employees allege the company's own artificial-intelligence tools scored them on protected medical and family leave.</s> <s>Those tools, they say, disproportionately selected disabled and pregnant staff among eight thousand people cut, one scientist dismissed the day before she gave birth.</s> <s>The plaintiffs want a court to block their firings while the case proceeds.</s>
</p>
<break time="1s"/>
<prosody rate="90%">
<s>That's your briefing.</s>
</prosody>
</speak>